  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Load one or more ABF current-clamp recordings, detect action potentials in each current-step sweep using voltage and dV/dt thresholds, extract eFEL electrophysiological features, review F-I curves, phase-plane plots and per-sweep debug traces, and export the results as CSV, Excel or PDF. Data used in the run: stock. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
